      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Among 37,857 operations in a general surgical department (1965-1975), 205 interventions on the small intestine were necessary- enterotomies, oversuturing, amputations and resections. The operations are evaluated with regard to etiology, clinical aspects and operative technique."},
